WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.054
Almost everything in LATYS is one shortcut away. Press Control K, to open the command bar.

00:00:05.510 --> 00:00:10.929
Start typing to find anything. Here, we'll spin up a Codex agent, right next to Nova.

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:17.124
Type a full sentence, and it becomes a message. Choose All agents, and the whole team hears it at once.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:24.296
And just like that, you have a team, working in parallel. Each one reports back on its own panel.
